<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Titanium Metals started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Titanium Metals started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Cathy Walton started coverage of Titanium Metals Corp with a near-term and long-term buy on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Tuesday at 30-1/4.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
